# Output
dist/
build/
output/

# Rendered corpora and benchmark runs. Both are derived: a corpus is
# reproducible from the tracked specifications in data/ plus a seed, and a
# run from a corpus. Rendered scans and audio reach gigabytes, so neither
# belongs in git.
corpus/
runs/

# Generation writes here and renames it into place, so a failure cannot leave a
# manifest from one run beside records from another. It should never survive a
# run, but a killed process can strand one.
*.staging/

